## <gno-icon name="code-outline" /> Check your code

Run these before you ship.

<gno-button href="https://docs.gno.land/resources/gno-testing" label="Testing guide" />

1. `gno fmt -w ./...`
2. `gno lint ./...`
3. `gno test ./...`

<gno-columns-sep>

## <gno-icon name="keyboard" /> Drive gnodev

Press these in its terminal.

<gno-button href="https://docs.gno.land/resources/gnodev" label="See all keys" />

- `A` show balances
- `P` `N` step through transactions
- `Ctrl+S` save the state until you quit
- `Ctrl+R` reset to the saved state, or to startup

